      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've did some research for it and noticed that FX layer without avatar mask to disable all muscle and transform will break all non-humanoid animation in Gesture layer, like tail/ear, even use default FX controller (un-check the custom FX at Descriptor component) it still block gesture layer animation.\nOne way can solve this issue is add the avatar mask on FX layer, the mask must have defined skeleton and unselect all transform, the problem with this way is if set the mask with defined skeleton, no matter all transform is disable or enable, the Material-change animation will not work anymore!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
